<title>USA: Loews Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Loews Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			$	 2.08	   $	 3.13</p>
<p> Net			     239,300		  368,800</p>
<p> Revs			  4,939,100		5,044,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs			115,000		  117,800</p>
<p>( All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Revenues include investment gains of $28.9 million and $311.7 million for the respective periods and excise taxes of $110.1 million and $109.3 million on sales of manufactured products for the respective periods.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
